  "subject": "chore: bump version to v1.0.2085",
  "body": "Signed-off-by: Zach Aller <zach_aller@intuit.com>\n",
  "references": [
    {
      "commit": {
        "author": "\"Zach Aller\" <code@example.com>",
        "date": "2026-10-27T13:03:00-05:00",
        "subject": "ci(e2e): check out the repo before setting up Go so the module cache restores (#2329)",
        "body": "actions/setup-go keys its module and build cache on go.sum, which has to\nbe in the workspace when the action runs. The e2e workflow ran setup-go\nbefore checkout, so every matrix leg logged\n\n  Restore cache failed: Some specified paths were not resolved, unable to cache dependencies.\n\nand re-downloaded the whole module graph from proxy.golang.org on each\nrun. Three legs per pull request made the suite the most exposed job to\nproxy stream errors (the \"make install\" failures seen on #2322 and\n#2324). Swap the two steps; ci.yaml already has them in this order.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01BmNNrks98vPwCpW9DDBQ6z\n\nSigned-off-by: Michael Crenshaw <350466+crenshaw-dev@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
        "sha": "5fe6339bd88eff88578d5d437167c7a7e54763df",
        "repoUrl": "https://github.com/argoproj-labs/gitops-promoter"
      }
    }
  ]
}
